      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. When they talk about it being a \"moral corruption\" or \"undermining human flourishing,\" it sounds like they aren't just disagreeing with new laws, but saying these changes are actually dangerous or harmful to society itself. Do they present this as an objective truth about how humans are supposed to function, or do they acknowledge that other people see these changes as progress?",
